    "paragraphs": [
        {
            "key": "0",
            "scene": "Premier's Office-总理办公室",
            "roles": [
                "Cherdenko-切尔登科"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "0-0",
                    "startTime": "00:00:11,758",
                    "endTime": "00:00:13,086",
                    "texts": [
                        "The premier is gone.\n总理跑了。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "1",
            "scene": "Premier's Office-总理办公室",
            "roles": [
                "Krukov-克鲁科夫"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "1-0",
                    "startTime": "00:00:13,186",
                    "endTime": "00:00:15,477",
                    "texts": [
                        "Yes, the coward has already fled.\n没错，这个懦夫已经逃走了。"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "key": "1-1",
                    "startTime": "00:00:15,783",
                    "endTime": "00:00:17,995",
                    "texts": [
                        "The USSR is at death's door comrade.\n苏联濒临死亡，同志。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "2",
            "scene": "Premier's Office-总理办公室",
            "roles": [
                "Cherdenko-切尔登科"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "2-0",
                    "startTime": "00:00:19,087",
                    "endTime": "00:00:21,227",
                    "texts": [
                        "Which is why we must hurry.\n所以我们要必须快速行动。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "3",
            "scene": "In elevator-电梯里",
            "roles": [
                "Cherdenko-切尔登科"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "3-0",
                    "startTime": "00:00:26,979",
                    "endTime": "00:00:30,477",
                    "texts": [
                        "Sir I beg you, please.\n长官，恳请你快点。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "4",
            "scene": "In elevator-电梯里",
            "roles": [
                "Krukov-克鲁科夫"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "4-0",
                    "startTime": "00:00:40,749",
                    "endTime": "00:00:43,766",
                    "texts": [
                        "What is this? Some sort of escape route.\n这是什么？某种逃生路线。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "5",
            "scene": "In elevator-电梯里",
            "roles": [
                "Cherdenko-切尔登科"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "5-0",
                    "startTime": "00:00:43,776",
                    "endTime": "00:00:50,274",
                    "texts": [
                        "No sir, twelve months ago, I was put in charge of a top secret project.\n不，长官。十二个月前，我被任命负责一个绝密项目。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "6",
            "scene": "In elevator-电梯里",
            "roles": [
                "Krukov-克鲁科夫"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "6-0",
                    "startTime": "00:00:50,738",
                    "endTime": "00:00:53,725",
                    "texts": [
                        "Whatever it is, it's too late.\n不管是什么，都已经太晚了。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "7",
            "scene": "In elevator-电梯里",
            "roles": [
                "Cherdenko-切尔登科"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "7-0",
                    "startTime": "00:00:54,056",
                    "endTime": "00:00:57,775",
                    "texts": [
                        "With respect general, you are wrong.\n恕我直言，将军，您错了。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "8",
            "scene": "In elevator-电梯里",
            "roles": [
                "Cherdenko-切尔登科"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "8-0",
                    "startTime": "00:01:10,205",
                    "endTime": "00:01:15,681",
                    "texts": [
                        "For you see sir, time is on our side.\n如您所见，长官，时间站在我们这边。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "9",
            "scene": "Time Machine-时间机器",
            "roles": [
                "Doctor-博士"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "9-0",
                    "startTime": "00:01:23,940",
                    "endTime": "00:01:29,882",
                    "texts": [
                        "It isn't ready. It hasn't been tested. We don't even know if it works.\n它还没有准备好。还没有测试过。我们甚至不知道它是否有效。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "10",
            "scene": "Time Machine-时间机器",
            "roles": [
                "Krukov-克鲁科夫"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "10-0",
                    "startTime": "00:01:29,892",
                    "endTime": "00:01:31,006",
                    "texts": [
                        "If what works?\n是否有效什么？"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "11",
            "scene": "Time Machine-时间机器",
            "roles": [
                "Doctor-博士"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "11-0",
                    "startTime": "00:01:31,340",
                    "endTime": "00:01:33,874",
                    "texts": [
                        "My time machine.\n我的时间机器。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "12",
            "scene": "Time Machine-时间机器",
            "roles": [
                "Cherdenko-切尔登科"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "12-0",
                    "startTime": "00:01:37,807",
                    "endTime": "00:01:40,085",
                    "texts": [
                        "Prepare these coordinates.\n准备这些坐标。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "13",
            "scene": "Time Machine-时间机器",
            "roles": [
                "Cherdenko-切尔登科"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "13-0",
                    "startTime": "00:01:56,105",
                    "endTime": "00:01:57,010",
                    "texts": [
                        "Get in.\n进去。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "14",
            "scene": "Time Machine-时间机器",
            "roles": [
                "Krukov-克鲁科夫"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "14-0",
                    "startTime": "00:02:01,742",
                    "endTime": "00:02:03,312",
                    "texts": [
                        "You can not be serious?\n你不会是认真的吧？"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "15",
            "scene": "Time Machine-时间机器",
            "roles": [
                "Cherdenko-切尔登科"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "15-0",
                    "startTime": "00:02:03,543",
                    "endTime": "00:02:08,213",
                    "texts": [
                        "Come comrade general! A new world order awaits...\n来吧，将军同志！新的世界秩序正在等待着……"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "16",
            "scene": "Brussels-布鲁塞尔",
            "roles": [
                "Doctor-博士"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "16-0",
                    "startTime": "00:02:47,313",
                    "endTime": "00:02:48,853",
                    "texts": [
                        "Touch nothing.\n什么都别碰。"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "key": "16-1",
                    "startTime": "00:02:48,863",
                    "endTime": "00:02:53,336",
                    "texts": [
                        "We mustn't do anything to disrupt space time continue.\n我们不能做任何扰乱时空的事情。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "17",
            "scene": "Brussels-布鲁塞尔",
            "roles": [
                "Krukov-克鲁科夫"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "17-0",
                    "startTime": "00:02:53,860",
                    "endTime": "00:02:54,840",
                    "texts": [
                        "Where are we?\n我们在哪？"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "18",
            "scene": "Brussels-布鲁塞尔",
            "roles": [
                "Cherdenko-切尔登科"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "18-0",
                    "startTime": "00:02:55,113",
                    "endTime": "00:02:58,715",
                    "texts": [
                        "Brussels 1927.\n1927年的布鲁塞尔。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "19",
            "scene": "Brussels-布鲁塞尔",
            "roles": [
                "Cherdenko-切尔登科"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "19-0",
                    "startTime": "00:02:59,737",
                    "endTime": "00:03:03,096",
                    "texts": [
                        "The Solvay International Physics Conference.\n索尔维国际物理会议。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "20",
            "scene": "Brussels-布鲁塞尔",
            "roles": [
                "Doctor-博士"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "20-0",
                    "startTime": "00:03:04,570",
                    "endTime": "00:03:06,420",
                    "texts": [
                        "Is that Einstein?\n那是爱因斯坦吗？"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "21",
            "scene": "Brussels-布鲁塞尔",
            "roles": [
                "Cherdenko-切尔登科"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "21-0",
                    "startTime": "00:03:06,430",
                    "endTime": "00:03:13,101",
                    "texts": [
                        "Yes doctor, the man most responsible for our enemies technological superiority,\n是的，博士，他是我们敌人科技优势的最大功臣。"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "key": "21-1",
                    "startTime": "00:03:13,628",
                    "endTime": "00:03:17,785",
                    "texts": [
                        "the man who made them invincible.\n他让他们不可战胜。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "22",
            "scene": "Brussels-布鲁塞尔",
            "roles": [
                "Doctor-博士"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "22-0",
                    "startTime": "00:03:17,914",
                    "endTime": "00:03:19,746",
                    "texts": [
                        "What do you plan to do?\n你计划怎么做？"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "23",
            "scene": "Premier's Office-总理办公室",
            "roles": [
                "Krukov-克鲁科夫"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "23-0",
                    "startTime": "00:03:43,333",
                    "endTime": "00:03:45,406",
                    "texts": [
                        "I do not understand.\n我无法理解。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "24",
            "scene": "Premier's Office-总理办公室",
            "roles": [
                "Doctor-博士"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "24-0",
                    "startTime": "00:03:46,656",
                    "endTime": "00:03:50,986",
                    "texts": [
                        "We have altered the past and changed the present.\n我们改变了过去，也改变了现在。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "25",
            "scene": "Premier's Office-总理办公室",
            "roles": [
                "Natasha-娜塔莎特工"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "25-0",
                    "startTime": "00:03:53,612",
                    "endTime": "00:03:55,783",
                    "texts": [
                        "Good to see you sir.\n很高兴见到你长官。"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "key": "25-1",
                    "startTime": "00:03:56,196",
                    "endTime": "00:03:58,844",
                    "texts": [
                        "I have the reports from the front that you requested.\n我收到了你所要求的前线报告。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "26",
            "scene": "Premier's Office-总理办公室",
            "roles": [
                "Krukov-克鲁科夫"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "26-0",
                    "startTime": "00:03:59,335",
                    "endTime": "00:04:01,594",
                    "texts": [
                        "Thank you. What do you have for me?\n谢谢。你要给我看什么？"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "27",
            "scene": "Premier's Office-总理办公室",
            "roles": [
                "Natasha-娜塔莎特工 "
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "27-0",
                    "startTime": "00:04:01,595",
                    "endTime": "00:04:05,167",
                    "texts": [
                        "I'm sorry comrade general. I meant premier Cherdenko.\n对不起将军同志，我的意思是总理切尔登科。"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "key": "27-1",
                    "startTime": "00:04:08,364",
                    "endTime": "00:04:12,556",
                    "texts": [
                        "So the allies are on the run. Soon western Europe will be ours.\n盟军正在溃败。很快，西欧就要落入我们的手中了。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "28",
            "scene": "Premier's Office-总理办公室",
            "roles": [
                "Cherdenko-切尔登科"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "28-0",
                    "startTime": "00:04:12,504",
                    "endTime": "00:04:14,141",
                    "texts": [
                        "Do you hear that general?\n听到了吗将军？"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "key": "28-1",
                    "startTime": "00:04:14,644",
                    "endTime": "00:04:17,447",
                    "texts": [
                        "Our enemies have been defeated.\n我们的敌人已经被击败了。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "29",
            "scene": "Premier's Office-总理办公室",
            "roles": [
                "Natasha-娜塔莎特工"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "29-0",
                    "startTime": "00:04:17,478",
                    "endTime": "00:04:20,813",
                    "texts": [
                        "Hold on sir. I'm receiving an emergency transmission from our northern base.\n长官，请稍等。我收到北方基地发来的紧急通讯。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "30",
            "scene": "Premier's Office-总理办公室",
            "roles": [
                "Fedorovich-通讯官 ",
                "Natasha-娜塔莎特工"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "30-0",
                    "startTime": "00:04:22,360",
                    "endTime": "00:04:28,037",
                    "texts": [
                        "They're attacking. They're too many. We have to evacuate!\n他们正在进攻。人数太多了。我们必须撤离！",
                        "Who is attacking?\n谁在攻击？"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "31",
            "scene": "Premier's Office-总理办公室",
            "roles": [
                "Yoshiro-日本天皇"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "31-0",
                    "startTime": "00:04:30,157",
                    "endTime": "00:04:34,355",
                    "texts": [
                        "The imperial war machine has been unleashed.\n帝国战争机器已经启动。"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "key": "31-1",
                    "startTime": "00:04:34,365",
                    "endTime": "00:04:38,701",
                    "texts": [
                        "Do not struggle against what is inevitable.\n不要与不可避免的事情作斗争。"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "key": "31-2",
                    "startTime": "00:04:38,744",
                    "endTime": "00:04:46,725",
                    "texts": [
                        "All who stand in the way of our divine destiny will be swept away by the march of history.\n一切阻碍我们神圣命运的人都将被历史的进程所淘汰。"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "key": "31-3",
                    "startTime": "00:04:47,118",
                    "endTime": "00:04:52,845",
                    "texts": [
                        "You will bow before us or you will cease to exist.\n你必须在我们面前屈服，否则你将不复存在。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "32",
            "scene": "Premier's Office-总理办公室",
            "roles": [
                "Natasha-娜塔莎特工"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "32-0",
                    "startTime": "00:04:53,956",
                    "endTime": "00:04:58,689",
                    "texts": [
                        "Sir, it appears that the Empire has mounted a full scale assault.\n先生，看来帝国已经发动了全面进攻！"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "33",
            "scene": "Premier's Office-总理办公室",
            "roles": [
                "Natasha-娜塔莎特工"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "33-0",
                    "startTime": "00:05:00,405",
                    "endTime": "00:05:02,950",
                    "texts": [
                        "The Empire of the Rising Sun, of course.\n当然是旭日帝国。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "34",
            "scene": "Premier's Office-总理办公室",
            "roles": [
                "Doctor-博士"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "34-0",
                    "startTime": "00:05:03,495",
                    "endTime": "00:05:06,260",
                    "texts": [
                        "We now have two mortal enemies?\n我们现在有两个不共戴天的敌人？"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "35",
            "scene": "Premier's Office-总理办公室",
            "roles": [
                "Krukov-克鲁科夫"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "35-0",
                    "startTime": "00:05:06,358",
                    "endTime": "00:05:09,739",
                    "texts": [
                        "We must unleash our nuclear weapons. Annihilate them all!\n我们必须释放核武器。把他们全部消灭！"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "36",
            "scene": "Premier's Office-总理办公室",
            "roles": [
                "Krukov-克鲁科夫"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "36-0",
                    "startTime": "00:05:15,437",
                    "endTime": "00:05:16,621",
                    "texts": [
                        "Our nuclear weapons. Our atomic bombs!\n我们的核武器。我们的原子弹！"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "key": "37",
            "scene": "Premier's Office-总理办公室",
            "roles": [
                "Doctor-博士"
            ],
            "sentences": [
                {
                    "key": "37-0",
                    "startTime": "00:05:16,692",
                    "endTime": "00:05:23,259",
                    "texts": [
                        "Don't you understand? Without Einstein, there is no nuclear weapons because we have altered the space time continue.\n你不明白吗？没有爱因斯坦就没有核武器，因为我们已经改变了时空的延续。"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "key": "37-1",
                    "startTime": "00:05:23,203",
                    "endTime": "00:05:27,849",
                    "texts": [
                        "Oh who knows what nightmares we have created.\n哦，谁知道我们创造了什么样的噩梦。"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
